      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Reference: briareus-windows. Other clients match this structure, differing only as noted here.\nA single 520px column, centred, with no sidebar or header. The logo is a 52px rounded tile in accent tint.\nThe card holds two edit rows separated by a rule: server URL (globe glyph, cue 'https://briareus.example.com') and Token (key glyph, password-masked, cue 'Token').\nEnter in the server field moves to Token, and Enter in Token connects. Connect is the prominent full-width button and reads 'Connecting…' while it works. A connection error appears as a notice box under it; the error text drawn here\nis a sample.\nThe token is stored in Windows Credential Manager. At pairing the app reads GET /api/v1/openapi.json to decide which controls to show.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
      "originalText": "Reference: briareus-windows. Other clients match this structure, differing only as noted here.\nA single 520px column, centred, with no sidebar or header. The logo is a 52px rounded tile in accent tint.\nThe card holds two edit rows separated by a rule: server URL (globe glyph, cue 'https://briareus.example.com') and Token (key glyph, password-masked, cue 'Token').\nEnter in the server field moves to Token, and Enter in Token connects. Connect is the prominent full-width button and reads 'Connecting…' while it works. A connection error appears as a notice box under it; the error text drawn here\nis a sample.\nThe token is stored in Windows Credential Manager. At pairing the app reads GET /api/v1/openapi.json to decide which controls to show.\nRegion names (sidebar, canvas, raise, sunken) are the theme.* roles; widths and margins are layout.* in tokens/. Greys only, on purpose.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
    }
